legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1088:{ ... }` is a parse error. A deferred call's arguments are typed by its parameters as in an ordinary
legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1232:**OWN-14@3.** A struct or enum declared `Copy` has only fields and payloads that are Copy when its type parameters are taken as Copy, so no Copy value ever contains a linear one.
