legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1290:**OWN-15@5.** Every surface expression, match-arm and statement constructor creates, moves, borrows, copies, overwrites or refuses its operands as its row in this entry's value-flow tables states, and no method call borrows its receiver implicitly.
