legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1365:| `fieldAccess` | place projection: a Copy field is copied, a non-Copy field read by value is **refused** (**E0290**, OWN-8); as a projection base, borrow target or assignment target it is a place (no flow); newtypes and `.0` are refused (OD54) | conservation (H11 rows) |
legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1400:| `forLoop` | the same rules as `while_`; the counted loop of OD47 desugars to `while_` in Core, its index an immutable Copy binder of the body | scope |
legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1420:| `intLit` `floatLit` `boolLit` `strLit` `charLit` | creates | same as value | n/a (not addressable) |
legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1422:| `binOp` `unaryOp` `cast` | reads Copy operands (a cast operand is checked as a place, so an illegal cast reports "cannot cast") | same | n/a |
legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1426:| `fieldAccess` `arrayIndex` | a Copy read copies; a non-Copy read is refused (E0290); the base is checked as a place | same as value | sub-place; no flow |
legacy/docs/spec/ownership.md:1428:| `borrow` `borrowMut` | the inner expression is checked as a place; the result `&T` is Copy and `&mut T` exclusive | same | n/a |
