legacy/docs/spec/SPEC.md:4219:aborts on NaN, an infinity or a value out of range. OD107 instead requires an error as `try_convert`; OD99 fixes the builtin spellings `trunc`, `round`, `floor`, `ceil`. Implementation remains pending R-0500.
