legacy/docs/spec/SPEC.md:11839:**PASS-2@2.** Every pattern binder's mode (by reference or by value) is decided once by the checker and carried explicitly in Core as the binder's type, and it is the same in every specialization, except that a whole-value binder over an owned scrutinee instantiated at a reference type may change mode where both modes bind the same value.
