legacy/docs/spec/SPEC.md:12118:**PASS-9@1.** Lowering produces SSA that passes the SSA verifier, with a runtime trap for every check the semantics requires (array bounds, integer overflow, division by zero and shift range) and with every defer and scope cleanup represented as edges of the control-flow graph.
